Teksto kon: ['html'] buhata: { <- (
		kaugalingon
		ilisi: ['&'] ug: ['&amp;'],
		ilisi: ['<'] ug: ['&lt;'],
		ilisi: ['>'] ug: ['&gt;'],
		ilisi: ['"'] ug: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lista bag-o.

['Verbatim Syntax'] mga-titik matag: { :numero :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (numero), Letter: letter).
}.

Gawas list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list hiusaha: ['↵']).

Gawas isulat: template.

